#. max 6143 bytes
msgctxt "0"
msgid "\nA simple combat style.\nThe result of Meltlilith's adoration of classical ballet,\nretuning herself with various attack skills.\nShe obtained diverse powers by converting the origins\nof already completed stories and stages into skills.\n\nThere are many references. The explanations are as follows.\n\n\"The Heel Named Curse Blade Giselle\"\nFrom the classical ballet \"Giselle\"\nDespairing from betrayal by her beloved Albrecht, Giselle\nuses his sword in a frenzied dance, during which she dies.\nWomen who die before marriage become ghosts known as wilis.\nShe became a wilis, who abduct and dance men to death, but…\n\n\"Unforgivable Hilarion\"\nFrom the classical ballet \"Giselle\"\nHilarion, who deceived Giselle, is caught by the Wilis and\npays for his crime. He is not forgiven, and without waiting\nfor dawn, they make him dance until he dies from exhaustion.\n\n\"Farewell, Albrecht\"\nFrom the classical ballet \"Giselle\"\nAlbrecht is caught by the wilis, but his life is spared\nwhen he's saved by one of them. As Albrecht,\nspared from death by exhaustion, raises his face,\nthe form of the girl he loved most fades like an illusion.\n\n\"The Siren Lights a Fire Inside\"\nFrom the classical ballet \"The Prodigal Son\"\nA rural lord's son runs away for a life in the city.\nMany temptations lurk in the city, the most extreme\nbeing the enchantress Siren, who corrupts men\nwith the wiles she's gained from a life of adversity.\n\n             ◆\n\nHowever, the lineage of these skills are mere distractions.\nCrime Ballet refers to how Meltlilith has been cheating.\n\nTo make herself invincible, Meltlilith rewrote a basic rule\non the Far Side of the Moon, \"the lack of a sense of time\"\nwith \"the lack of hit detection on Meltlilith.\"\n\nInstead of training herself thoroughly, Meltlilith's act\nof altering the rules of the world to grant herself\na privilege out of selfishness is itself a criminal act.\n\n\n"
msgstr ""

#. max 6143 bytes
msgctxt "1"
msgid "\nA simple combat style.\nThe result of Meltlilith's adoration of classical ballet,\nretuning herself with various attack skills.\nShe obtained diverse powers by converting the origins\nof already completed stories and stages into skills.\n\nThere are many references. The explanations are as follows.\n\n\"The Heel Named Curse Blade Giselle\"\nFrom the classical ballet \"Giselle\"\nDespairing from betrayal by her beloved Albrecht, Giselle\nuses his sword in a frenzied dance, during which she dies.\nWomen who die before marriage become ghosts known as wilis.\nShe became a wilis, who abduct and dance men to death, but…\n\n\"Unforgivable Hilarion\"\nFrom the classical ballet \"Giselle\"\nHilarion, who deceived Giselle, is caught by the Wilis and\npays for his crime. He is not forgiven, and without waiting\nfor dawn, they make him dance until he dies from exhaustion.\n\n\"Farewell, Albrecht\"\nFrom the classical ballet \"Giselle\"\nAlbrecht is caught by the wilis, but his life is spared\nwhen he's saved by one of them. As Albrecht,\nspared from death by exhaustion, raises his face,\nthe form of the girl he loved most fades like an illusion.\n\n\"The Siren Lights a Fire Inside\"\nFrom the classical ballet \"The Prodigal Son\"\nA rural lord's son runs away for a life in the city.\nMany temptations lurk in the city, the most extreme\nbeing the enchantress Siren, who corrupts men\nwith the wiles she's gained from a life of adversity.\n\n"
msgstr ""

#. max 6143 bytes
msgctxt "2"
msgid "\nAlter Egos are High Servants created as\na composite amalgamation of Heroic Spirits.\n\nBB accessed the Moon Cell's Servant Archives, chose\ngoddesses compatible with each Ego, and reproduced the data.\nAlter Egos came into existence as composite goddesses.\n\nMeltlilith is made up of three goddesses.\n\n\nThe first is the chaste goddess Artemis of Greek mythology.\nLinked with the tides, and thus the moon's movements,\nshe would take aim with mana to shoot unfailingly,\nand at the same time, bring plague and death.\n\nThe second is the crossed snake staff originating from\neither Old Testament's Leviathan or Ugaritic myths' Lotan.\nIt has the same origin as the staff Moses used to split\nthe Red Sea, also acting as a symbol of the split sea.\nAllows its holder to change properties like water, making\nthem adaptable to any situation. They may also freely\nchange their form, even to the shape of the holder's envy.\n\nThe third is the Hindu river goddess, Saraswati.\nShe holds the ability to control \"things that flow\"\nlike water & wind, music & words, speech, poetry & prose\nand such natural phenomena. The flow of her timbre can\nexcite any emotion from the hearts of those who hear it,\nand moreover, interfere with the flow of electricity\nin a computer network.\n\n"
msgstr ""

#. max 6143 bytes
msgctxt "3"
msgid "キーワード２偽名テキスト"
msgstr ""

#. max 6143 bytes
msgctxt "4"
msgid "\nThe Noble Phantasm that BB granted this Alter Ego.\n\nOriginally, it was not an Anti-Unit but an Anti-Populace,\nAnti-World Noble Phantasm. Not something to be used\nin combat or on a warrior, but against something in\nthe range of a civilization with an established culture.\n\nMeltlilith's sweet honey melts not only the body,\nbut even the spirit. This Noble Phantasm dissolves the\ngood sense and morals of a community, shaping it into\na single body resembling a colony.\n\nTrampling on the bodies, hearts, societies that have\nturned to slime, she absorbs the power they had.\n\nThat it shows such effectiveness against non-combatants\nis due to Meltlilith's depravity leaking out.\n\n             ◆\n\nThe one used as a basis was one of the Seven Lucky Gods,\na goddess like the Three Goddesses of Munakata and Ugajin;\nBenzaiten.\n\nIt is the biwa of Benzaiten who controls \"things that flow\"\nlike water & wind, music & words, speech, poetry & prose\nand such natural phenomena, given form as a Noble Phantasm.\nBenzaiten's origin is the Hindu river goddess, Saraswati.\nBorn of the creation god Brahma, but was unable to stand\nhis passionate gaze, who desired her as his consort due to\nher overwhelming beauty, so she desperately ran from him,\nmaking her a goddess that's timid in the face of love.\nSaraswati is a goddess presiding over art and education,\nand when she came to be worshiped as Benzaiten,\nshe gained the ability to increase property as well.\n\n"
msgstr ""

#. max 6143 bytes
msgctxt "5"
msgid "宝具・偽名のテキストを記述します。"
msgstr ""

#. max 6143 bytes
msgctxt "6"
msgid "\nA skill that gives modifiers to one's aggression in battle.\nIt sounds like a favorable skill, but the longer its holder\nstays in battle, the more their sadism grows, causing them\nto lose their normal composure. You could say it's just\none step short of the skill that makes Berserkers rampage.\n\nThe more they attack, the stronger they become,\nbut on the other hand, their defensive abilities drop.\nWith the added disadvantage of unconsciously lowering\ntheir chances of escape, you could say this skill has\nbad compatibility with the usually-composed Meltlilith.\n\n"
msgstr ""

#. max 6143 bytes
msgctxt "7"
msgid "スキル１偽名テキスト"
msgstr ""

#. max 6143 bytes
msgctxt "8"
msgid "\nA special ability, called id_es,\nthat Alter Egos possess since their creation.\n\nA cheat skill that evolved from \"Absorption.\"\nThe highest rank of energy drain.\nDraining, copying, and scaling down are all possible.\n\nThe drain process has two parts. \nFirst, the virus #ROFS0003#RUBS poison#RUBEhoney#REND produced in Meltlilith's body \nis injected into the target and fuses the parameters \nto be stolen: [experience], [skills], [capacity], etc. \nThen she absorbs, converts, and unifies with the parameters\nliquified by the virus.\n\nAs long as it has form, it can be drained, regardless of\nwhether it's organic or not, but things without form……\nthings like spiritual nature and skills can be fused,\nbut making them \"her own\" is difficult, so she can only\nuse them as simple nutrients.\n\nFor this reason, what Meltlilith primarily makes \"her own\"\nis mainly \"experience\" and \"capacity.\"\n\n             ◆\n\nWith this ability, Meltlilith planned to augment\n\"her own transcription.\" She created a transferable virus\ncapable of melting the entire contents of an digital frame\nand transfigure them into herself…… Meltlilith.\n"
msgstr ""

#. max 6143 bytes
msgctxt "9"
msgid "スキル２偽名テキスト"
msgstr ""

#. max 6143 bytes
msgctxt "10"
msgid "\nThe Riding ability.\nAs long as it's an existing animal, even if it is a wild,\nit can be ridden. Usually, only knight Servants\nsuch as Saber or Rider would have this skill but……\n\nWhy Meltlilith has this skill\nshould be left to the imagination. \n\n"
msgstr ""

#. max 6143 bytes
msgctxt "11"
msgid "スキル３偽名テキスト"
msgstr ""

#. max 6143 bytes
msgctxt "12"
msgid "\nNeurological Disorder:\nHumans have 5 senses―sight, sound, smell, taste & touch,\nand use those five sensors to understand the outside world,\nand as a result, comprehend their own state of being.\n\nHumans fundamentally use these passive senses to interact\nwith the world. Unconsciously using the excellent sensors\nknown as the five senses, they take in the ordinary.\n\nHowever, if any of the five senses degrade,\nthe consciousness must actively face the outside world.\nThat which was passive becomes active.\n\nFor example, someone who lost their sight will deliberately\nspecialize in their remaining four senses for use as even\ngreater sensors. Ironically, their perception will get\nseveral times better than someone who has all five senses.\n\n             ◆\n\nAs for Meltlilith's 5 senses, her touch has deteriorated.\nEspecially her hands―――she's nearly lost all sensation\nin her fingers, so she's become quite proactive in\nher relationship with the outside world.\n\nIt's thought that even her sadistic tendencies\nultimately arose \"because I'm the only one who can't\nfeel the existence of other people.\"\n\nOn a side note, because her fingers are so clumsy,\nin spite her hobby of collecting figures,\nshe can't immerse herself in assembling garage kits.\nCurrently accepting applications for a skilled assembler!\n\n"
msgstr ""

#. max 6143 bytes
msgctxt "13"
msgid "設定１偽名テキスト"
msgstr ""

#. max 6143 bytes
msgctxt "14"
msgid "\nThe End of Pleasure:\nAn Ego born from BB's \"Desire to Serve\" and \"Pleasure.\"\nThe kind of abnormally precious girl that men can't help\nbut want to protect―――was the case, but because her skill\nlets her continuously steal her opponent's abilities,\nshe currently holds an aggressive disposition.\n\n             ◆\n\nIn spite of how she takes in others,\nshe doesn't care to understand or sympathize with them\nbecause Meltlilith can't understand the feelings of others.\n\nShe doesn't need other people.\nShe doesn't understand dreams or love.\nIn a situation where she acquired \"love,\" she would\nprobably dedicate everything to attend to the target of it.\n\nTo the self-sufficient Meltlilith, their feelings\naren't worth considering. She would declare in\nan oppressive manner that what she feels is correct.\n\nWith no intention of conversing with them\n(oh, I love you more than enough to need that),\nwith no desire to touch them\n(oh, that degree of pleasure is unsatisfactory),\nwith no mind to say she wants them to love her.\n(oh, mutual understanding and such is unnecessary)\n\nTruly, what a domineering Ego devoted to 'no's and 'not's.\nBeneath the constant condescension and oppressive attitude, \nthere's not a speck of doubt or hesitation in her,\nonly a genuine \"awakening to love.\"\n\n             ◆\n\nMeltlilith hasn't noticed.\nThat her true foundation is one who doesn't need others,\nan incarnation of \"self-pleasure.\"\n\nWhat lies at the core of Meltlilith is\n\"devotion to the one she's fallen in love with.\"\n\nShe repeatedly used Drain to raise her level\nand decided to take over the Moon Cell\nso she could offer supreme pleasure to her loved one.\n\nProtect her loved one → take them into herself →\nwithin her, (even if she changes to the point she doesn't\nknow herself anymore) they'll continue to live on forever.\nShe's determined that this is the highest form of love\nshe can offer to her loved one.\n\nFrom Meltlilith's perspective, even BB and Lip\nare just \"foreign bodies that I feel I have to save.\"\n\n             ◆\n\n……however, those feelings are too closed off.\nFor her, whose only certainty was her own feelings,\nwhose connection with the outside world was insufficient,\n\"loving someone else\" was itself a fatal #RUBS   bug#RUBEerror#REND.\n\n"
msgstr ""

